Keep a shared content as empty text.
Keep a shared line as empty text.
To seek from spot (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If spot is more than finish, return.
The piece is the slice of wanted from spot to spot plus 1.
If piece matches symbol, set bracket to spot, return.
Seek from spot plus 1 with finish.

To look from place (a whole number).
If place is more than the last position of contents, return.
If item place of contents matches wanted, set atspot to place, return.
Look from place plus 1.

To attach from spot (a whole number).
Set line to item spot of groups.
Place "," into line.
Place fullpath into line.
Set item spot of groups to line.

To collect from place (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If place is more than finish, return.
The part is item place of parts.
The final is the last position of part.
Set wanted to part.
Set symbol to empty text.
Place "(" into symbol.
Set bracket to -1.
Seek from 0 with final.
The nameend is bracket.
The name is the slice of part from 0 to nameend.
Set content to the slice of part from bracket plus 1 to final.
Set fullpath to empty text.
Place folder into fullpath.
Place "/" into fullpath.
Place name into fullpath.
Set wanted to content.
Set atspot to -1.
Look from 0.
If atspot is less than 0, Place content into contents.
If atspot is less than 0, Place fullpath into groups.
If atspot is at least 0, Attach from atspot.
Collect from place plus 1 with finish.

For each listing in listings.
Set parts to split listing by " ".
Set folder to item 0 of parts.
Collect from 1 with the last position of parts.

The spot is the last position of groups.
Repeat while spot is at least 0.
Show item spot of groups.
Subtract 1 from spot.
